.git

# Local env files must never enter the build context (the image is configured
# at runtime via ECS task-definition env vars and Secrets Manager).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local build output and dependencies — the builder stage installs and builds
# from source, so these only bloat the context.
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
